---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { researchAreas, siteMeta } from '../data/site';

const title = 'UQC Research Group';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home / 首页" description={siteMeta.description}>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="page-shell hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Research group / 课题组</div>
        <h1>Questions<br />with precision.<span>用精确的方法，探索值得回答的问题。</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">UQC Research Group is a calm, structured home for research, people, publications, and the questions that connect them. This first release is a reviewable website prototype.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/research/">Explore research <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="/contact/">Contact / 联系</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero-aside" aria-label="Prototype note">
        <div class="aside-kicker">UQC · 01 / 06</div>
        <h2>A clear public starting point.</h2>
        <p>Minimal JavaScript, local-first assets, and structured content prepared for future maintenance.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="page-shell">
      <div class="notice" role="note">
        <div aria-hidden="true">✦</div>
        <div><strong>{siteMeta.notice.en}</strong>{siteMeta.notice.zh}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="page-shell">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">What we study / 研究内容</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">Three spaces for<br />focused inquiry.<span>三个面向深入探索的研究空间。</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="muted-copy">The cards below are structured demo fields. Replace them with approved research directions when the group’s public wording is ready.</p>
          <a class="section-link" href="/research/">View all research / 全部研究方向</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="research-grid">
        {researchAreas.map((area) => (
          <article class="research-card card-border">
            <span class="research-number">{area.number}</span>
            <h3>{area.title.en}<span>{area.title.zh}</span></h3>
            <p>{area.summary.en}</p>
            <div class="tag-row">
              {area.tags.map((tag) => <span class="tag">{tag}</span>)}
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="page-shell split-band">
      <div class="quote-panel">
        <p>“A good research website leaves room for the work to speak.”</p>
        <small>对研究保持克制，也为新的问题留出空间。</small>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-panel">
        <h3>Built to stay easy to maintain.</h3>
        <p>People, papers, and news live in one structured data file for the prototype. Astro generates static pages at build time, keeping the visitor experience quick and the maintenance path clear.</p>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/people/">Meet the group / 了解成员 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
